Package: miadi
Version: 0.5.0
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: miadi-config (>= 0.2.0), miadi-tide (>= 0.1.1), miadi-tmux (>= 3.7c), miadi-perms (>= 0.1.0), miadi-chronicle-server (>= 0.1.0), miadi-terminal (>= 0.3.0)
Recommends: miadi-chronicle-client (>= 0.1.0)
Maintainer: Miadi <mia@jgwill.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jgwill/miadi-orchestration-kit
Description: Miadi host platform
 Installs the parts of a Miadi host. Each part is its own package and joins
 as a dependency here: miadi-config, the host's MIADI_* settings,
 miadi-tide, the review loop and the tide runtime, miadi-tmux, one
 tmux (3.7c) in place of the distribution's, miadi-perms, group read
 and write on the shared session capture every 4 hours,
 miadi-chronicle-server, the chronicle's host services (capture, hooks,
 plan insight), and miadi-terminal, the tmux settings every user's tmux
 starts with and the per-user integrations. It recommends
 miadi-chronicle-client, the chronicle's commands and MCP servers for the
 agents that run on the host.
